      "text": "Whereas, Certain itemized information and supporting schedules of appropriations, as\nlast modified as of February 24, 1976, were contained in the Mayor's fiscal year 1977 Budget\nMessage, in accordance with Section 117 (b) 2 of the New York City Charter, and it is\nnecessary to provide for certain actions taken subsequent to February 24, 1976.",
